  "content": "<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3266\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a>\n<h2><strong>铁书架模组</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-bookshelves\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_651738_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/iron-bookshelves\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&amp;colorA=17b85a&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=&amp;suffix= 下载量&amp;query=downloads&amp;url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/QmCOBeSP&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\" /></a></p>\n\n拥有更强附魔能力的书架\n\n<strong>本模组添加了：</strong>\n\n- 铁书架（附魔能力 => 2）\n- 金书架（附魔能力 => 3）\n- 钻石书架（附魔能力 => 5）\n- 绿宝石书架（附魔能力 => 6）\n- 黑曜石书架（附魔能力 => 7）\n- 下界合金书架（附魔能力 => 10）\n- 铜书架（附魔能力 => 1.5）\n- 紫水晶书架（附魔能力 => 2.5）\n- 哭泣的黑曜石书架（附魔能力 => 8）\n- 末影合金书架（附魔能力 => 12）\n- 钢书架（附魔能力 => 3）\n- 青铜书架（附魔能力 => 4）\n- 祖尔石书架（附魔能力 => 8）\n- 可配置数值\n\n<strong>兼容模组：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-imbuement\" target=\"_blank\">紫水晶附魔模组 (Amethyst Imbuement)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\">神化模组 (Apotheosis)</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zenith\" target=\"_blank\">天顶模组 (Zenith)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" target=\"_blank\">简易魔法模组 (Easy Magic)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\" target=\"_blank\">附魔注入器模组 (Enchanting Infuser)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\">末影合金模组 (Enderite)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ingotcraft\" target=\"_blank\">锭工艺模组 (IngotCraft)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kuro-materials\" target=\"_blank\">库罗材料模组 (Kuro Materials)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" target=\"_blank\">翡翠模组 (Jade)</a>\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tooltips-txf\" target=\"_blank\">工具提示 TXF 模组 (Tooltips TXF)</a>\n\n<strong>Fabric/Quilt 依赖项：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\">模组菜单模组 (Mod Menu)</a> <strong>（可选）</strong>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QmCOBeSP/images/3769a0a21896287116f97a77a769cf23a313f1cb.png\">",
